{
  "_comment": [
    "What the SRD's feats do to the numbers, written as effects (see web/engine/effects.js).",
    "",
    "A feat named here brings these effects with it the moment it is taken: nobody",
    "types Toughness's +3 hit points. `{choice}` is what the feat was taken on - the",
    "skill for Skill Focus, the weapon for Weapon Focus. An effect with a",
    "`condition` is listed beside its number, never added. `notes` are what a feat",
    "does that is not a number on the sheet, shown with the character's abilities.",
    "",
    "  perCopy         added again, and this much more, for each further time taken (Psionic Talent)",
    "  perPsionicFeat  the value is multiplied by the psionic feats taken (Psionic Body)"
  ],
